                },
                {
                  "text": "<div>Apply firm, sustained compression to the glans to reduce oedema, then attempt to slide the foreskin forward</div>",
                  "correct": true,
                  "tipsAndFeedback": {
                    "tip": "",
                    "chosenFeedback": "<div>Correct. Sustained compression reduces glans swelling, after which the foreskin can often be slid forward over the corona. A penile nerve block aids tolerance of the manoeuvre.</div>",
                    "notChosenFeedback": ""
